+name: dispatch_terminal_report
+
+# C-09 步骤 2 (contract/cases.md §1, FR-3 判据1: 结论消息回流播报确实产生,
+# 且只经既有快脑通道). Drives a real dispatch (no TASK_DISPATCH_CLI stub —
+# unlike dispatch_nonblocking.yaml, this scenario needs the real
